## 14. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Invalid status transitions | M | H | Enforce transition rules on the server. |
| Unauthorized status updates | M | H | Verify ownership and permissions. |
| Incomplete activity history | M | M | Test history retrieval across lifecycle states. |

## 15. Rollout Plan

- Deploy database changes before dependent code, if required.
- Test with existing development data.
- Enable the feature after lifecycle and authorization tests pass.
- Roll back code and migrations safely if deployment fails.

## 16. Test Plan

- **Unit** — Status transitions and authorization rules.
- **Integration** — Status updates and activity history retrieval.
- **End-to-end** — Complete and cancel posts; verify My Page history.
- **Security** — Reject unauthorized updates.
- **Accessibility** — Check keyboard navigation and accessible status labels.
- **Manual** — Verify lifecycle flows on desktop and mobile.

## 17. Documentation & Training

- Document status meanings and available actions for users.
- Update API documentation.
- Document status transition rules for developers.

